OL,5,G0000 World's Deadliest Weather: Caught
OL,6,G     on Camera
OL,7,     FThe Meixcan holiday hotspot,
OL,8,     FAcapulco, is hit by
OL,9,     Frecord-breaking Hurricane Otis. In
OL,10,     Fthe UK, endless rainfall turns
OL,11,     Flandscapes into lakes, devastating
OL,12,     Fcommunities.
OL,13,G0100 Outback Truckers
OL,14,     FJared and Johnny's epic mission
OL,15,     Fgrinds to a halt, Roscoe battles
OL,16,     Fthe elements on a world-famous
OL,17,     Frally, and Turbo is flagged down
OL,18,     Fby the boys in blue.
